{"id": 439733, "field": "description", "en": "Shapeshift into the Tree of Life. While in this form you increase healing received by $439745s1% for all party members within $439745a1 yards, Wild Growth healing is increased by $439734s8%, your heal over time spells cost $439734s1% less, you gain $439734s2% increased Spirit, you gain $439734s3% increased armor, and you cannot cast harmful spells.\r\n\r\nThe act of shapeshifting frees the caster of Polymorph and Movement Impairing effects.", "hash": "c887c72f657d9665", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70291"}
{"id": 439733, "field": "aura", "en": "Immune to Polymorph effects.\r\nReduces mana cost of heal over time spells by $439734s1%.\r\nIncreases Spirit by $439734s2% and armor by $439734s3%.\r\nIncreases healing received by $439745s1% for all party members within $439745a1 yards and healing done by Wild Growth by $439734s8%.", "hash": "3b08cc5b67df8768", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70291"}
