{"id": 439748, "field": "name", "en": "Starfall", "hash": "c6c6cea4db691368", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70291"}
{"id": 439748, "field": "description", "en": "You summon a flurry of stars from the sky over $d, striking targets within $439755a yards of your location, each dealing ${$439753m1*$<damagepower>/100} to ${$439753M1*$<damagepower>/100} Arcane damage to its target and ${$439756m1*$<damagepower>/100} Arcane damage to all other enemies within $439756a1 yards. Maximum 20 stars.\r\n\r\nShapeshifting or mounting cancels the effect. Any effect which causes you to lose control of your character will suppress the Starfall effect.\r\n\r\nBenefits from and triggers most talents and effects that trigger or benefit from Moonfire.", "hash": "16bd2a8dc8712cfd", "src": "db2@1.60.1.70291"}
